{
  "file" : "npc/quests/quests_geffen.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've never heard of me? Why, I'm the Veteran Blacksmith of this land. I've spent 30 years in this hot and bloody hellfire, bending steel to my iron will!",
      "translation" : "没听说过我？我可是这片土地上资历最深的铁匠。在这灼热又残酷的炉火旁，我已度过三十年，凭着钢铁般的意志锻造钢材！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But...",
      "translation" : "不过..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am growing older and my prowess begins to fade with age. So I've invented something for young, hot, upcoming Blacksmiths, in hopes that they too will master my craft...",
      "translation" : "我渐渐老了，手艺也开始随着年纪退步。于是我发明了一件东西，送给年轻有为的新晋铁匠，希望他们也能掌握我的技艺..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What is it?",
      "translation" : "是什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We Blacksmiths must always manipulate steel under extreme heat, and the hot air and melted metals are more than most people can stand.",
      "translation" : "我们铁匠总得在高温下锻钢。灼热的空气和熔化的金属，可不是一般人受得了的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For the sake of our craft, our beautiful, yet masculine faces are put at risk...",
      "translation" : "为了这门手艺，我们英俊又阳刚的脸庞总是面临危险..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But with this wonder of technology, there's no need to worry! Behold, the ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 !!",
      "translation" : "有了这项了不起的发明，就不用担心了！看啊，^3355FF焊接面罩^000000!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It works by covering your face with a fat metal plate. Truly, it's an item that everyone should want! If not yourself, it'd be a good idea to give this to a friend who is studying smithing.",
      "translation" : "它用一块厚实的金属板遮住脸。真是人人都该拥有的好东西！自己不用的话，送给正在学习锻造的朋友也不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So how about it ? If you give me ^2244FF50 Steel^000000 and ^4422FFonly 2000 Zeny^000000, I will make it for you right away~!!",
      "translation" : "怎么样？给我^2244FF50个钢铁^000000和^4422FF区区2000 Zeny^000000，我马上就替你做好~!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm... Not bad. Alright.",
      "translation" : "嗯...还不错。好吧"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How does it work again?",
      "translation" : "它是怎么用的来着？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I see that you appreciate a Blacksmith's work! Alright, I'll do it right away !!",
      "translation" : "啊，看来你很欣赏铁匠的手艺！好，我这就开工!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahaha~! Make good use of that!",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈~!好好使用它吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You do not have the items I require.",
      "translation" : "你没有带齐我需要的物品。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A common Blacksmith would interpret this as a sign of disrepect, but I will forgive you. Just don't forget what I need if you want me to make you this mask.",
      "translation" : "一般的铁匠会把这当成侮辱，不过我就原谅你吧。想让我替你制作面罩的话，可别忘了我需要的材料。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The ^3355FFWelding Mask^000000 protects your face by covering it with a fat metal plate. This invention is the result of 30 years of endless toil at the hammer and anvil.",
      "translation" : "^3355FF焊接面罩^000000用厚实的金属板保护你的脸。这项发明是我三十年来在铁砧旁不懈劳作的成果。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Blacksmith]",
      "translation" : "[铁匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah...!",
      "translation" : "啊...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess this is the first time you've met a Blacksmith as great as me, and you're just speechless with awe. Please, take your time and speak up when you are ready.",
      "translation" : "看来你还是第一次遇到我这么了不起的铁匠，已经敬佩得说不出话了。别着急，准备好了再开口吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFThis guy seems",
      "translation" : "^3355FF这家伙看起来"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a little full",
      "translation" : "有点"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Blacksmith",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of himself.^000000",
      "translation" : "太自恋了。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please listen",
      "translation" : "请听听"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "to my story",
      "translation" : "我的故事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of my blessed",
      "translation" : "关于我敬爱的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "grandfather.",
      "translation" : "祖父。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk",
      "translation" : "谈谈"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask about Items needed",
      "translation" : "询问所需材料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Manufacture",
      "translation" : "制造"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Quit",
      "translation" : "退出"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My Grandfather, who passed away a few years ago, was special to me. He always stayed with me, and took care of me. He was much better than my old man, who was always busy working.",
      "translation" : "几年前去世的祖父对我来说非常特别。他总是陪伴并照顾我，比整天忙着工作的父亲好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "To me, Grandfather's library was always like a fantasy land where I could escape. I spent most of my time there.",
      "translation" : "对我而言，祖父的图书馆就像一个可以逃避现实的幻想世界。我大部分时间都待在那里。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I learned a lot of things from his books in the Library. Grandfather was interested in Alchemy and Music, and his Library was filled with many mysterious old books.",
      "translation" : "我从图书馆里的藏书学到了很多。祖父对炼金术和音乐很感兴趣，图书馆里堆满了许多神秘的古书。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "One day...",
      "translation" : "有一天..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As usual, I went to the Library and discovered an interesting schematic.",
      "translation" : "我像往常一样去了图书馆，发现了一张有趣的设计图。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It showed some instrument which looked like Ear Muffs that, when worn on the head, could transmit music or whispers to the ears through a thin wire.",
      "translation" : "图纸上画着一种像耳罩的装置，戴在头上后，就能通过细线把音乐或低语传到耳边。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess...",
      "translation" : "我想..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is my grand father's unfinished work. I met a few Alchemists and asked them to produce it, but they rejected my offer...",
      "translation" : "那是祖父未完成的作品。我找过几位炼金术士，请他们帮忙制作，可他们都拒绝了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In the end, I thought 'I've gotta make it myself.' So I researched for a few years, and now I fully understand how to make that thing. But, I could never gather the materials to make it!",
      "translation" : "最后我想，'干脆自己来做！'于是研究了几年，现在我已经完全弄懂了制作方法。可是，我一直凑不齐材料！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If I can get those articles, I would build it right away. If you are interested in my idea, would you bring them for me?",
      "translation" : "只要拿到那些材料，我马上就能把它做出来。你要是对我的想法感兴趣，可以帮我把材料带来吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "All I wanna do is build this thing in honor of my grandfather and finish the work he started. If you ask me to keep it, I wouldn't mind.",
      "translation" : "我只想为了纪念祖父，完成他开始的工作。你若愿意让我留下成品，我也不会介意。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "40 ^3355FFSteel^000000",
      "translation" : "40个^3355FF钢铁^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFOridecon^000000",
      "translation" : "1个^3355FF神之金属^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFAlcohol^000000",
      "translation" : "1个^3355FF酒精^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1 ^3355FFCoal^000000",
      "translation" : "1个^3355FF煤矿^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "These are the things I need for Grandfather's masterpiece.",
      "translation" : "这些就是完成祖父杰作所需的材料。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Tap! Tap! Tap!*",
      "translation" : "*嗒！嗒！嗒！*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you.",
      "translation" : "谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Because of you, I could accomplish my grandfather's wish. He would be happy if he looked down on me from Heaven.",
      "translation" : "多亏了你，我才能实现祖父的愿望。如果他能从天上看着我，一定会很高兴。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As I said, please take this. I am just proud that I can make this by myself.",
      "translation" : "我说过了，这个请收下。我只是为能亲手做出它而感到自豪。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for trying to help me, but you didn't bring all the items I need. I think you will find them all soon though.",
      "translation" : "谢谢你愿意帮我，不过你带来的材料还不齐。我想你很快就能找齐的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Eric]",
      "translation" : "[埃里克]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "N-no?",
      "translation" : "不、不吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well...",
      "translation" : "这样啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You have your own",
      "translation" : "你也有自己的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "worries, I suppose.",
      "translation" : "烦恼吧，我想也是。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Eric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Farewell.",
